- **`validate-dest-prefix`**: Enables validation of destination prefixes in flowspec rules.  
- **`validate-redirect-ip`**: Enables validation of the `redirect-to-IPv4` action in flowspec rules.  

To **disable** these checks (revert to defaults), prepend `no` to the commands:
```cli
configure router bgp
    flowspec
        no validate-dest-prefix
