    exit
exit
```  

**Notes**:  
- Configure these under `config>router>bgp>flowspec`.  
- By default, both validations are disabled (`no validate-dest-prefix` and `no validate-redirect-ip`).  
- Enabling these checks ensures flowspec rules are validated before installation, improving security during DDoS mitigation.
