To set up dynamic route sharing with another ISP using BGP on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following configuration commands. Replace the placeholders with your specific details:

```bash
configure router
   autonomous-system <LOCAL_AS_NUM>
   bgp
      group "ISP_GROUP"
