2. Check received routes from partners with `show router bgp neighbor <IP> received-routes`.
3. Validate session capabilities with `show router bgp neighbor <IP> advertised-capabilities`.

If routes still don't exchange, verify export policies permit VPN prefix advertisement and that next-hop resolvability exists in the transport layer.
