- `graceful-restart` enables helper functionality so peers retain routes during your router's reboot.  
- `restart-time 300` sets the wait period to 300 seconds (default is 120), giving legacy devices more time to handle reconvergence.  
- `enable-notification` allows graceful handling during notification-based restarts.  

Apply this globally to affect all BGP peers. For specific groups/neighbors, use the same structure under `group` or `neighbor` contexts.
