To adjust the periodic connection-check settings for a specific BGP neighbor to prevent unexpected session drops, use the following CLI commands to configure a custom **hold-time**:

```cli
configure router bgp
    neighbor <neighbor-ip>
        hold-time <seconds>
    exit
exit
