To configure BGP on your Nokia 7750 SR with AS 65001 as the parent and sub-ASes 65100 and 65200 grouped internally, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router
    autonomous-system 65001
    confederation 65001 members 65100 65200
    bgp
        group "INTERNAL_CONFED"
